# Run Off (running-app)

This workspace folder is **Run Off** — an Expo 56 React Native running app with local activity recording and a **live Supabase backend** (auth, activities, teams, feed, matches).

## Before non-trivial work

1. Read the **run-off** skill: `.cursor/skills/run-off/SKILL.md` (patterns, anti-patterns, checklist).
2. Check **milestone order**: `milestones/README.md` — do not implement later milestones without updating deps.
3. Follow **Expo 56 docs**: https://docs.expo.dev/versions/v56.0.0/

## Non-negotiables

- **`ActivityRecord`** with cumulative `distanceMeters` is the canonical activity model.
- **Level (XP) and Rank (competitive)** are separate systems — never couple them.
- **Charts**: shared distance grid for x-axis and data (`src/utils/chartAxis.ts`).
- **Navigation**: custom `src/navigation/` — not Expo Router.
- **Scope**: minimal diffs; match existing code style.
- **Database**: catalogs in Postgres (`rank_tiers`, …); read `supabase/migrations/` + `src/types/database.ts` before DB work; regenerate types after migrations.
- **Users in DB**: Auth creates `auth.users`; trigger provisions `profiles` + progression (milestone 02 Phase A).
- **Docs on ship**: update README + milestones + SCHEMA when shipping a phase — see skill § Docs sync.

Deep risks and file map: `.cursor/skills/run-off/reference.md`
